# MadGraph5 batch script: p p > q q~ l+ l- l+ l- at LO, QCD=0
# Pure electroweak: VBF Higgs (H→ZZ→4l), ZZ/WZ associated production, quark EW radiation
# Define light-quark aliases (b omitted to keep subprocess count manageable)
define q = u d s c
define q~ = u~ d~ s~ c~
generate p p > q q~ l+ l- l+ l- QCD=0
output pp_to_qq4l_qcd0 -nojpeg
